        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia Chateau Entrance Handleset</b>\r\n<p>From the textured surface to the ornate styling, this Omnia made Chateau entrance handleset is reminiscent of Baroque Era in France. A kingly richness emanates from this entry handleset that is only reinforced by the excellent craftsmanship that Omnia is known for. Despite its old world styling, there is nothing antiquated about the extra heavy duty mortise lock, which is made of durable zinc dichromate finished steel.</p>\r\n<p>\r\nEach set contains door levers, backplates, mortise latchset, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates. Key functions are supplied with lock cylinder/s and turnpiece as applicable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: <a href=\"/products/decorative-door-lever-mortise-lockset-omnia-52233\"><b>Matching Lockset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC1_size.gif?v=1704354673\" width=\"400\" heigth=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Chateau Entry Handleset: \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" solid brass throw with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable armored steel front for beveled conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass curved lip strike: 4-7/8\" high by 11/4\" wide with a 11/4\" lip to center. Finished to match trim. Dust box shipped with set.</li>\r\n<li>The Omnia <b>Max Brass Finish</b> is guaranteed never to tarnish even in extreme elements. Especially recommended for harsh environments such as salty air.</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Chateau Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1-3/4\" door thickness standard.</li>\r\n<li>Available with either 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Plate Length: 17-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Plate Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-mortise-handleset-data-sheet.pdf?v=1704262251\" target=\"new\">Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>When Selecting a Function</b>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Standard:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside. The outside is operated by a thumbpiece outside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside.</li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside and a thumbpiece on the outside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside. Turning of inside knob or lever will retract both dead-bolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside. The outside is operated by a thumbpiece. Deadbolt activated only by key on both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n<p><i>The inside trim will match the handleset finish.</i></p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Chateau Entrance Handleset Omnia",
                "description": "Omnia Chateau Entrance Handleset - From the textured surface to the ornate styling, this Omnia made Chateau entrance handleset is reminiscent of Baroque Era in France. A kingly richness emanates from this entry handleset that is only reinforced by the excellent craftsmanship that Omnia is known for. Despite its old world styling, there is nothing antiquated about the extra heavy duty mortise lock, which is made of durable zinc dichromate finished steel. Available in 3 finishes.",
                "keywords": "Omnia Chateau entrance handlesets, Chateau omnia handlesets, Chateau handle sets, entrance handlesets omnia, mortise lock handlesets, OMN-Chateau, omnia Chateau 059 knob handlesets, omnia Chateau 251 lever handlesets, ornate door handlesets, fancy handlesets, oval knob handlesets, decorative ornate handlesets, baroque doorhardware,"
